<%#
# «Служебные»

A collapsed block of the clinic card: the decisions of the owner that differ from
clinic to clinic and are not part of any plan (one chat per patient, the second
auto-assignment engine, the clinic's own OpenRouter key). Each switch says in one
line what it does; changing one asks first, and the change is written to the audit
log of the clinic. Plans never touch these functions.

The switches post `enabled_features[feature_<flag>]` (a hidden «false» before the
checkbox, so an unchecked switch is sent too) to the normal update of the clinic,
the same way «Тонкая настройка» does. The question before saving is built in the
browser from the `data-confirm-on` / `data-confirm-off` text of each switch that
moved.

## Local variables:

- `account`: the clinic (Account).
%>
<% switches = SuperAdmin::FineTuning.new(account).service_switches %>

<% if switches.any? %>
  <details class="admin-collapse" id="service-flags" data-testid="service-flags-block">
    <summary>
      <span class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-0.5">
        <span class="text-heading-2 text-n-slate-12"><%= t('super_admin.service_flags.title') %></span>
        <span class="text-body-main text-n-slate-11"><%= t('super_admin.service_flags.hint') %></span>
      </span>
      <span class="admin-collapse__chevron i-lucide-chevron-down size-4" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </summary>
    <div class="admin-collapse__body">
      <%= form_with url: super_admin_account_path(account), method: :patch, local: true, class: 'flex flex-col gap-4', data: { service_flags_form: true } do %>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <% switches.each do |switch| %>
            <label class="admin-switch-row cursor-pointer font-normal" for="service-<%= switch.name %>" data-flag="<%= switch.name %>">
              <span class="admin-switch-row__text">
                <span class="admin-switch-row__title"><%= switch.label %></span>
                <span class="admin-switch-row__hint"><%= switch.hint %></span>
              </span>
              <span class="admin-switch">
                <%= hidden_field_tag "enabled_features[feature_#{switch.name}]", 'false', id: nil %>
                <%= check_box_tag "enabled_features[feature_#{switch.name}]", 'true', switch.enabled, id: "service-#{switch.name}", class: 'admin-switch__input',
                                  data: { confirm_on: switch.confirm_on, confirm_off: switch.confirm_off } %>
                <span class="admin-switch__track" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="admin-switch__thumb" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </span>
            </label>
          <% end %>
        </div>

        <p class="admin-block__note"><%= t('super_admin.service_flags.note') %></p>
        <div class="admin-block__footer">
          <%= submit_tag t('super_admin.shell.save'), name: nil %>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </details>

  <script>
    (function () {
      var form = document.querySelector('[data-service-flags-form]');
      if (!form) return;
      form.addEventListener('submit', function (event) {
        var questions = [];
        form.querySelectorAll('input[type="checkbox"]').forEach(function (box) {
          if (box.checked === box.defaultChecked) return;
          var text = box.checked ? box.getAttribute('data-confirm-on') : box.getAttribute('data-confirm-off');
          if (text) questions.push(text);
        });
        if (questions.length > 0 && !window.confirm(questions.join('\n\n'))) event.preventDefault();
      });
    })();
  </script>
<% end %>
